# Driving this demo makes the engine write its per-run state next to the spine
# file it was pointed at -- which, for the shipped demo, is this tracked
# directory. Those side-cars are scratch from someone trying the demo, not
# content this example ships, and they embed the driver's own absolute paths.
#
# This is a deliberate exception to the root .gitignore's "engine journals are
# NOT excluded" rule. That rule protects the tamper-evident audit trail of a
# real run under .agent-work/. This spine is a throwaway fixture with no run
# history to preserve: `python make_demo_spine.py` resets it from scratch.
spine.json.journal
context/
mechanical/
